# TAS new-game → strategic map (TAS framework P4).  Custom single-player game:
#   title → Single player → Custom game → Choose-title Continue → page-7 setup
#   → Start → (RNG map gen + load) → strategic map.
# Start triggers FUN_004329ec → FUN_00497ced (the new-game world initialiser,
# which GENERATES the overworld from the RNG) → screen 0 / state 3.
#
# Run (turbo):
#   nix develop -c python3 -u tools/frida_capture.py --remote cutestation.soy:27042
#     --skip-intro --turbo --anchor-trace
#     --input-segtrace tools/traces/new_game_to_map.jsonl --run-id newgame1
#
# Coords GAME space (640x480); lParam=(y<<16)|x.  Within the TITLE segment t is
# RELATIVE to the TITLE anchor frame.  Hotspots (engine_menu_input.c):
#   Single player (320,107)=7012672 ; Custom game pg2 (320,211)=13828416 ;
#   Continue pg4 (432,227)=14877104 ; Start pg7 (281,208)=13631769.
{"wait": "TITLE"}
{"t": 60, "m": 512, "w": 0, "l": 7012672}
